[2026-11-27T21:13:28.887Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_194","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > /tmp/link-cli-207-reports/hive-mind.md <<'EOF'\n### Reproduction\n\nRun \"'`/fix --ci-cd` on a repository with a required root-layout check that disallows arbitrary root files, such as link-foundation/link-cli. The initial draft commit can contain only the generated root `.gitkeep`.\n\nIn the observed [draft](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/pull/208), [commit 26852bd](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/commit/26852bd276b6cdeef98316fae6d2526e2de80483) created the placeholder. The [required JavaScript stage](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/actions/runs/46067171135) failed with `Unexpected root path: .gitkeep`. The shared stage gate then prevented Rust and C# checks from running. link-foundation/link-cli#207 collects the logs. Earlier placeholder cleanup work in #1528 and #2215 addresses expensive path-filtered jobs and preventing a placeholder from leaking into a final merge. Required checks can still fail as soon as the draft opens.\n\nA local reproduction from a clean checkout of that repo is to add a root `.gitkeep`, stage it, and run `node --test js/test/repo-layout.test.mjs` (or run the JavaScript stage'\"'s \"'`npm run test:js` command inside `js/`).\n\n### Workaround and proposed change\n\nRemove the generated file as part of the first real patch. Keep the repository'\"'s required checks and root allowlist in place.\n\nTeach the draft creation path to try a payload-free Git commit where the host accepts an empty comparison, or allow a repository-configured placeholder path before falling back to a root file. If GitHub rejects a compare without a content diff, use the configured path instead. Keep the existing cleanup and placeholder-only detection for the fallback. Add a regression that prepares a solver draft against a repository with an unconditional layout guard and verifies that a supported placeholder strategy leaves the required check green.\nEOF\nrg -n 'Unexpected root path|unexpected root path' dev/log/issues/207/pulls/208/github/branch-javascript-46067171135.failed.log | head -3\nrg --files js/test | rg 'layout'\ncat /tmp/link-cli-207-main-refresh.log\ngit status --short --untracked-files=normal | tail -8\nls -l /tmp/link-cli-207-dotnet-403-format.log\nrg -n '\"'^      - .*warning|--branch'\"' .github/workflows/wasm.yml\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
