[2026-11-27T21:49:34.609Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_675","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\npath = Path('/tmp/link-cli-207-pr-body.md')\nbody = path.read_text()\nbody = body.replace('Main publishing requires a successful trusted-publisher preflight. Registry diagnostics distinguish package setup from a lookup outage.', 'Main publishing requires a successful trusted-publisher preflight. A separate read-only job downloads the exact published version anonymously. Registry diagnostics distinguish package setup from a lookup outage.')\nbody = body.replace('- Run \"'`npm --prefix js run lint`'\"', '- The [hosted etcd job](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/actions/runs/46069793278/job/140744356887) passed the revised scenario in both journal modes. The anonymous package check downloaded \"'`@link-foundation/link-cli-client@0.5.0` and reproduced npm HTTP 404 for `@link-foundation/link-cli-server@0.1.1`.'\"\\\\n- Run \"'`npm --prefix js run lint`'\"')\npath.write_text(body)\nPY\nsed -n '1,32p' /tmp/link-cli-207-pr-body.md\"","aggregated_output":"Fixes #207\n\n## Changes\n\n- Keep read-only checks for each default-branch revision and independent dispatch. Replace only superseded PR synchronization checks. Queue repository release writers so a later publish cannot displace a pending one.\n- Remove the generated root `.gitkeep`. Preserve required status checks, language stage order, and golden fixture receipts.\n- Verify the replacement etcd leader while the original member is paused. After it rejoins, verify convergence, refusal of the stale transaction, and a linearizable read through the resumed member. Set `ETCD_TEST_VERBOSE=1` or dispatch JS Client CI with **Record etcd election status and member debug logs** to capture election evidence.\n- Validate both npm tarballs and their size against the JS template’s budget on pull requests and checks-only dispatches. Main publishing requires a successful trusted-publisher preflight. A separate read-only job downloads the exact published version anonymously. Registry diagnostics distinguish package setup from a lookup outage.\n- Cover shared stage inputs and integration examples in JS package triggers. Enforce a 30-minute workflow job timeout ceiling with documented caps for longer suites and release jobs. Resolve the Rust and C# source-size warnings and include release fragments.\n\n## Reproduce and verify\n\n- Draft #208 at `26852bd` fails `node --test js/test/repositoryLayout.test.mjs`. This test passes after removal of the placeholder.\n- The [original conformance run](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/actions/runs/46062568123) reproduces the etcd failure. JS Client CI runs the real cluster in both journal modes. Run `node --test experiments/issue-138/etcd-harness.test.mjs` for the focused election checks.\n- The [two main-branch checks](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/actions/runs/46059980457) [cancelled under overlapping revisions](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/actions/runs/46059980682) show the concurrency failure. Run the CI governance and workflow policy tests in `.github/scripts` to exercise the policy.\n- The [hosted etcd job](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/actions/runs/46069793278/job/140744356887) passed the revised scenario in both journal modes. The anonymous package check downloaded `@link-foundation/link-cli-client@0.5.0` and reproduced npm HTTP 404 for `@link-foundation/link-cli-server@0.1.1`.\n- Run `npm --prefix js run lint`, `npm --prefix js run test:js`, `node parity/check-parity.mjs --base origin/main`, and `npm pack --dry-run --json | node ../../.github/scripts/check-npm-tarball-size.mjs` from each npm package directory.\n- This environment has no installed pre-commit hooks. The relevant checks were run manually, including workflow policy, JavaScript and Python quality, secrets, Rust formatting and lint, .NET formatting on the CI SDK, Actionlint and zizmor.\n\n## Registry setup still needed\n\nThe npm server package is absent from the public registry, and its OIDC exchange returns HTTP 404. An npm scope maintainer needs to publish the first public version, configure GitHub trusted publishing for `link-foundation/link-cli` and `js-server.yml`, and run JS server CI on `main` with **Verify npm trusted publishing** enabled before retrying the main workflow. The PR’s tarball and code checks run independently. The real publishing criterion remains open until the maintainer steps and main verification succeed. [Failed preflight](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/actions/runs/46067149214)\n\n## Evidence and upstream reports\n\n- [Investigation, timeline and requirements](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/blob/issue-207-ac4b1e2ba1ef/docs/case-studies/issue-207/README.md)\n- [Run logs, template file comparison and local verification](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/blob/issue-207-ac4b1e2ba1ef/dev/log/issues/207/pulls/208/README.md)\n- [Rust template #275](https://github.com/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/issues/275), [JS template #325](https://github.com/link-foundation/js-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/issues/325), [C# template #121](https://github.com/link-foundation/csharp-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/issues/121), [Python template #173](https://github.com/link-foundation/python-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/issues/173), [Java template #39](https://github.com/link-foundation/java-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/issues/39), [C++ template #45](https://github.com/link-foundation/cpp-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/issues/45), [Hive Mind #4186](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/4186)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
